return ['domain'=>'page-builder-sandwich','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'page-builder-sandwich','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-28T06:11:08+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-28T06:11:08+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Page Builder Sandwich','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/page-builder-sandwich','The foundation release of the rebuilt Page Builder Sandwich: a settings and About screen, a footprint-free front-end output layer, and one sample content block.'=>'重构后的 Page Builder Sandwich 的基础版本：包含设置和关于屏幕、无搜索引擎痕迹的前端输出层以及一个示例内容块。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'AI 提供商','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'ChatGPT 的开发者。一个全能的好帮手。','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Claude 的开发者。擅长写作与严谨推理。','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Google 的 Gemini 模型。快速且经济实惠。','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'一家拥有快速且经济实惠模型的欧洲人工智能公司。','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'擅长写作与代码的高性价比模型。','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'一个密钥，适用于来自许多不同提供商的模型。','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'任何像 OpenAI 的 API 一样运行的服务，包括在您自己的计算机或服务器上运行的模型。','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'通用（在未设置更具体选项时使用）','Writing and rewriting'=>'写入与重写','Translation'=>'翻译','Code and CSS'=>'代码和 CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'抱歉，您无权访问此页面。','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'以下插件共用这些设置：%s。','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'您的密钥已在此网站的数据库中加密，且只会发送至您所选的提供商——绝不会发送给我们。','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'第 1 步（共 2 步）：选择 AI 提供商','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'您使用自己的密钥，因此您直接向服务商支付实际使用的费用。不确定吗？以下这些都可以很好地运行；您以后还可以添加更多。','Next'=>'下一步','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'第 2 步，共 2 步：连接 %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'请输入您的 OpenAI 兼容服务地址，以 /v1 结尾。仅当服务要求时才需要密钥。','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'打开 %s 并登录（或创建一个免费账户）。','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API 密钥页面','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'创建新密钥并将其复制。','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'将其粘贴在下方，然后点击“保存并测试”。我们会发送一个小请求来检查其是否正常工作。','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'大多数提供商需要在账户中有少许余额后，密钥才能生效：%s。','add credit'=>'添加额度','← Choose a different provider'=>'← 选择其他提供商','Address'=>'地址','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'已保存的密钥以……%s结尾——请粘贴新密钥以替换它','Key (optional)'=>'密钥（可选）','API key'=>'API 密钥','Save and test'=>'保存并测试','Providers'=>'服务商','Provider'=>'提供商','Status'=>'状态','Key'=>'密钥','Get a key'=>'获取密钥','Test'=>'测试','Remove'=>'移除','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'被更新的插件版本保存：请更新此插件，或重新输入密钥。','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'已保存的密钥无法再打开（网站的安全密钥已更改）。请重新输入。','Not connected'=>'未连接','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'已连接 — 上次测试通过 %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'上次测试失败：%s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'已连接 — 尚未测试','Which model to use'=>'使用哪个模型','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ 表示我们针对该任务的推荐。此列表包含您的密钥可以使用的所有模型，直接从提供商实时读取。','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— 推荐服务商 —','Save models'=>'保存模型','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'从提供商处刷新模型列表','Images'=>'图片','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'连接 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 以生成图片。','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— 首家接入提供商的最新图像模型 —','best quality'=>'最高画质','lowest cost'=>'最低成本','fastest'=>'最快','Add a model yourself'=>'自行添加模型','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'今天发布了新模型？输入其准确名称即可立即使用。','Model name'=>'模型名称','Add model'=>'添加模型','Recommended models list'=>'推荐模型列表','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'无法验证推荐模型列表，因此不显示任何推荐。请重新安装插件，或在下方开启每日更新。','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'正在使用的列表发布于 %s。每个插件更新都会带来一个新的列表。','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'请每天也查看一次 Zinn Digital® 以获取更新后的列表。','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'只发送纯下载请求：不包含密钥、网站地址，也没有关于您内容的任何信息。该列表经过签名，未通过签名检查的列表将被忽略。','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'最后检查于 %1$s：%2$s。','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'保存，如已开启则立即检查','a newer list was installed'=>'已安装更新的列表','already up to date'=>'已经是最新版本','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'下载未通过签名检查，已被忽略','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'无法连接到 Zinn Digital®；当前列表将继续使用','turned off'=>'已关闭','Open'=>'打开','Check their status page'=>'查看其状态页面','Open your billing page'=>'打开您的账单页面','Open your API keys page'=>'打开您的 API 密钥页面','Open the AI settings'=>'打开AI设置','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'很抱歉，您无权执行此操作。','Unknown provider.'=>'未知服务商。','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'输入您的服务地址，例如 http://localhost:11434/v1。','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'这看起来不像 API 密钥。请重新复制，不要包含空格。','Paste your API key first.'=>'请先粘贴您的API密钥。','Key removed.'=>'密钥已移除。','Models saved.'=>'已保存模型。','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'请输入模型的准确名称，例如照供应商文档中的写法输入。','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'已添加 %s。请在“使用哪个模型”下进行选择。','Model removed.'=>'已移除模型。','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'每日更新已关闭。将使用插件自带的列表。','Checked: %s.'=>'已勾选：%s。','Model lists refreshed.'=>'模型列表已刷新。','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'您的 AI 密钥已被某个插件的较新版本保存。请更新此插件，或在 AI 设置中重新输入密钥。','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'您保存的 AI 密钥已无法打开（网站的安全密钥已更改）。请在 AI 设置中重新输入。','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI 尚未设置。请在 AI 设置中添加 AI 提供商的密钥。','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'此任务未选择模型。请在 AI 设置中选择一个。','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'此版本的插件不支持该 AI 提供商。','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'未连接能够生成图像的 AI 提供商。请在 AI 设置中添加 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 密钥。','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法生成图像。请在 AI 设置中选择 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 以生成图像。','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'您的 AI 密钥无法使用任何图像模型。请向提供商检查该密钥的权限，或为图像选择其他提供商。','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'本网站无法连接到您的AI服务。请检查该服务是否正在运行，且其地址可从您的网络服务器访问（托管网站无法访问您本地计算机上的服务）。','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'无法访问 %s。请检查其状态页面；如果该网站运行正常，则可能是您的主机正在阻止出站连接，或者地址输入错误。','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s 表示您的账户已无可用额度或配额。请在其账户中添加额度或提高限制，然后重试。','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s 未接受您的密钥。它可能输入错误、已被撤销或已过期。请创建一个新密钥并将其粘贴在此处。','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s 拒绝了此密钥的请求。该密钥可能无权访问此模型或功能，或者您的账户需要验证。','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'您的密钥无法从 %2$s 获取模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型。','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'您的 %2$s 方案不包含模型 "%1$s"。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型，或通过他们升级您的方案。','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s 限制了您的密钥发送请求的速度。请稍候片刻再试，或者提高您与该方的速率限制。','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s 目前遇到问题（对方服务器出现宕机或过载）。您的设置没有问题。请稍后重试。','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'AI 请求因未知原因失败。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请将以下详细信息提供给客服支持。','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI提供商返回了此插件无法读取的格式。请重试；如果问题持续存在，请选择其他模型或联系支持人员。','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'自定义 (兼容 OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'请先为该服务商保存密钥。','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'您的密钥有效，但提供商未列出该密钥对应的文本模型。请在下方自行添加模型。','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'已连接：%1$s 使用 %2$s 接听。您的人工智能功能已准备就绪。','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的用户角色不允许在本网站上使用人工智能。请联系管理员。','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 消费限额。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高限额。','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'此网站已达到每月的 AI 请求额度上限。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高该额度。','Usage and cost'=>'使用情况和费用','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'日志、限制和角色权限适用于通过以下方式使用的 AI：%s。','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'费用为约数，根据公布的价格计算；没有已知价格的型号计为零。','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'本月：%1$s 个请求，约 %2$s。','When'=>'当','Who'=>'谁','Used for'=>'用于','Model'=>'型号','Tokens in / out'=>'输入 / 输出','About'=>'关于','Result'=>'结果','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'尚未发出任何 AI 请求。','Done'=>'已完成','Limits and permissions'=>'限制与权限','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'每月消费限额（US 美元）','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'留空则表示不设限制。当大致费用达到该限额时，AI将在该月的剩余时间内停止服务。','Monthly request limit'=>'每月请求限制','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'留空则不设限制。','Who may use AI'=>'谁可以使用 AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'不勾选则允许所有能够使用该插件功能的人使用 AI。管理员始终可以使用。','Save limits and permissions'=>'保存限制和权限','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'限制和权限已保存。','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'安全错误，请刷新页面后重试。','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'缺少简报设置。请联系管理员。','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'无效的时事通讯设置。请联系管理员。','Invalid email address.'=>'无效的电子邮件地址。','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'尝试次数过多。请在几分钟后重试。','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'出错了，请联系管理员。','Map'=>'映射','Background video'=>'背景视频','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s：已存储 %2$d 个字体文件，样式表 %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'该系列未存储。','Removed.'=>'已移除','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'这不是一个有效的字体系列名称。','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts 未返回该字体族