ent is about.'=>'点击您评论所指的页面部分。','Client review'=>'客户审核','That part of the page could not be found: it may have been changed or removed since the comment was made.'=>'找不到该页面的这一部分：自发表评论以来，它可能已被更改或删除。','Review link'=>'检查链接','Let a client comment on this page'=>'允许客户在此页面上发表评论','Anyone with the link can see this page, even before it is published, and leave comments. No account is needed.'=>'拥有链接的任何人都可以查看此页面（甚至在发布之前）并发表评论。无需帐号。','Copied'=>'已复制','Copy link'=>'复制链接','Make a new link (the old one stops working)'=>'创建新链接（旧链接将失效）','Comments (%d open)'=>'评论（%d 条未处理）','Show resolved comments'=>'显示已解决的评论','No comments to show.'=>'暂无评论。','Reply'=>'回复','Send reply'=>'发送回复','Show in the editor'=>'在编辑器中显示','Resolve'=>'解决','Reopen'=>'重新打开','Open Sandwich Studio'=>'打开 Sandwich Studio','Change styles'=>'更改样式','Custom CSS and HTML'=>'自定义 CSS 和 HTML','Manage templates'=>'管理模板','Use AI'=>'使用人工智能','Client mode: text and images only'=>'客户端模式：仅限文本和图像','Role settings saved.'=>'角色设置已保存。','Roles and client mode'=>'角色和客户模式','Choose what each role can do in the builder. Administrators can always do everything. Client mode locks the layout and design, so the role can only change text and images.'=>'选择每个角色在构建器中可以执行的操作。管理员始终可以执行所有操作。客户端模式会锁定布局和设计，因此该角色只能更改文本和图像。','Role'=>'角色','Save role settings'=>'保存角色设置','Saved. Reload the page to see the new names.'=>'已保存。请重新加载页面以查看新名称。','White label'=>'白标','Rename the builder and hide our branding on this site'=>'重命名构建器并在本网站上隐藏我们的品牌','Shown everywhere the product name appears: menus, the editor, notices.'=>'显示在产品名称出现的任何地方：菜单、编辑器、通知。','Leave empty to use the builder name.'=>'留空则使用生成器名称。','Description on the Plugins screen'=>'插件屏幕上的说明','A Dashicons name (for example dashicons-admin-customizer) or an https:// image address.'=>'Dashicons 名称（例如 dashicons-admin-customizer）或 https:// 图片地址。','Hide the plugin from the Plugins screen'=>'在插件屏幕中隐藏插件','Agency users who still see the real product and these settings'=>'仍然能看到真实产品和这些设置的代理机构用户','%d new'=>'%d 条新信息','%d replaced'=>'